; One variable: vertical_alignment FILL with an item with nothing in it before a [p]. The item's line has
; no height but counts as a line (rich_text_label.cpp:1643-1648), so the gap spreads over it. An empty
; colour, font, underline or strikethrough adds no line (:3712-3727), so its cell keeps two lines.

